      "I have walked through most of the towers I am about to rank, sat in the sales offices, ridden the lifts at peak hour to see how they cope with load, and talked to owners association managers about what actually breaks first. This is not a list assembled from listing portals. It is opinion, informed by having seen these buildings do what buildings do over time, and I will tell you plainly where I think the money is well spent and where I think you are paying for a brand name that the building itself does not fully back up.",
