      "Family stability is a consideration that comes up often with aviation staff specifically, given how much time pilots and long-haul crew spend away from home on rotation. A spouse or partner managing a household largely solo during multi-day trips values the concierge and service layer that Jumeirah Residences provides, valet, housekeeping options, building security, more than a typical dual-income household might, since it removes a category of domestic logistics that falls entirely on the partner at home during absences. Several of our aviation clients have specifically cited this as the deciding factor over a larger but less serviced villa further from the city center, trading square footage for a lower daily burden on the partner managing the household during long rotations.",
